GetAverage [SimTalk]
Returns the average value of the values that the Display designated by <Path> recorded.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.GetAverage → real
Return Value
The return value has the data type real.
Example
print MyDisplay.GetAverage
GetAverage [SimTalk]
